38	Instantly.ai V2 API MCP Server - Email automation and campaign management.
39	
40	Categories: accounts, campaigns, leads, emails, analytics, background_jobs
41	Total tools: 38 (configurable via TOOL_CATEGORIES env var)
42	
43	Authentication methods for HTTP deployments:
44	1. URL path: /mcp/YOUR_API_KEY
45	2. Header: Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY (Bearer prefix optional)
46	3. Header: x-instantly-api-key: YOUR_API_KEY
47	"""
48	
49	# Initialize FastMCP server
50	mcp = FastMCP(
51	    name=SERVER_NAME,
52	    version=SERVER_VERSION,
53	    instructions=SERVER_INSTRUCTIONS,
54	)
55	
56	
